# Anchored to the repository root, because the CLI writes its cache beside whichever
# directory it is run from. An unanchored `data` would also swallow src/piglet/data,
# and cached responses carry whole bodies and every response header.
/data/
/piglet/data/
.claude/.quality-pending

# Subagent reports — reviews, drafted assertions, implementation summaries.
# Working notes for one step, not a record of the project: what survives a step
# belongs in docs/ or in an ADR, deliberately, not by accumulating here.
.piglet-work/
